{
    "background_story": "Samson grew up in a small rural town where propane was a lifeline for many families. His father owned a propane delivery business, and from a young age, Samson would ride along on deliveries, learning the ins and outs of the trade. After his father's passing, Samson took over the business, determined to keep the family legacy alive. He worked tirelessly to expand the company, investing in new technologies and hiring more staff to meet the growing demand. Under Samson's leadership, the business flourished, and he became known for his fair prices and reliable service. As the town's go-to propane expert, Samson was always ready to lend a helping hand, whether it was fixing a leaky tank or delivering a emergency refill on a cold winter night.",
